// About A Quarter To Nine (1935)

Tempo 120
Keysig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove BossaNovaIntro

Begin Solo
    Voice JazzGuitar
    Volume f
    Articulate 110
    Harmony OpenBelow
    Octave 5
    Begin Riff
        8c+;e+;b;d+; a;c+;g;b;
        8f;a;4d; f;d;
        1c;
        4d;e;f;
    End
End

Swingmode On
Swell m mp 4

1         C
2         Dm7
3         C
4         Dm7  /  G7

Repeat
Groove BossaNova
Volume m

5         C      /    Dm7
6         C      /      /  Ebdim
7        G7      /   Edim
8        G7      /      /    Dm7

Groove BossaNovaPlus
Volume mp

9        G7      /   Edim
10       G7      /    Dm7
11        C      /    Dm7
12        C     G7

Groove BossaNova
Cresc mf 8

13        C      /    Dm7
14        C      /      /  Ebdim
15       G7      /   Edim
16       G7      /      /    Dm7

Groove BossaNovaPlus

17       G7      /   Edim
18       G7      /     Dm     G7
19        C      /    Dm7
20        C      /    Eb7

Groove BossaNovaSus
Volume m

21       Ab
22      Eb7
23       Ab      /     Fm
24      Dm7      /     G7

Groove BossaNova1SusPlus
Decresc mp 4

25      Em6
26       Bm      /    Bb+    Bm7
27       E7
28       A7      /     D7     G+

Groove BossaNova1Sus
Cresc mf 8

29        C      /    Dm7
30        C      /      /  Ebdim
31       G7      /   Edim
32       G7      /      /    Dm7

Groove BossaNova
Decresc mp 2

33       G7      /   Edim
34       G7      /    Dm7

RepeatEnding
Volume mp

35        C
36        /

RepeatEnd

Groove BossaNovaEnd
Decresc ppp 2

35        C
36        / / z!
